# Smallest possible run: for proving the harness works end to end, not for
# measuring anything. 20 seconds at 50 qps is far too short and too light to
# say anything about WAF cost — the percentiles come from ~1000 requests and
# the spread between repeats will swamp the delta.
#
# Pair it with reduced pod sizing on a small cluster, e.g.
#   BACKEND_REPLICAS=1 BACKEND_CPU_REQUEST=200m LOADGEN_CPU_REQUEST=500m
QPS="50"
DURATION="20s"
CONNS="4"
